ime  achievement academy award for his entire  body of work and contributions to film  at the 2022 oscars  oh i'm sorry did i break your  concentration  i didn't mean to do that please  continue  in the second installment of the iron  man series one of the two villains tony  stark faces off against is weapons  manufacturer justin hammer played by sam  rockwell rockwell has received critical  acclaim for several of his roles but he  received his first academy award in 2018  for his role as jason dixon in three  billboards outside ebbing missouri  rockwell would later earn another  academy award nomination the next year  for his portrayal of president george w  bush and vice  natalie portman played thor's main love  interest jane foster in both the  original thor film and the 2013 sequel  thor the dark world after a nine year  wait portman has returned to the  franchise as mighty thor for the hero's  fourth solo outing thor love and thunder  portman has been nominated for an  academy award three times best  supporting actress for closer and best  actress for black swan and jackie she  won the award for black swan thanks to  her intense portrayal as a perfectionist  ballerina who slowly starts to lose her  sanity while pursuing the lead role in a  production of swan lake  odin the ruler of asgard for all three  entries in the original thor trilogy was  played by legendary actor anthony  hopkins hopkins has been acting since  the 1960s and he's earned two academy  awards and six nominations during his  storied career his first win came for  his iconic performance as hannibal  lecter in the best picture-winning  horror movie the silence of the lambs  his second came for his role as a man  suffering from dementia in the father  the parts couldn't be more different but  both performances are nothing less than  masterful i don't know about my mommy i  want her to come and veg me i  want to go home  the last of the original mcu avengers to  get a proper film introduction was steve  rogers in his debut film captain america  the first avenger taking place during  world war ii the film follows steve as  he joins the army and becomes the  figurehead for a super soldier program  that transforms him into the superhero  we all know today one of the military  leaders of the program is colonel  chester phillips played by tommy lee  jones tommy lee jones has been nominated  for an academy award four times he won  best supporting actor for his role as  deputy u.s marshal sam gerrard in the  1993 action film the fugitive  the final installment in the iron man  trilogy iron man 3 featured a very  controversial twist to what many people  initially perceived to be the film's  main villain in the opening moments of  the film the mandarin is set up to be  the most intense villain that tony stark  has ever faced instead the man turns out  to be trevor slattery an actor hired by  the real villain to serve as a  distraction regardless of whether or not  you think that the mandarin twist work  ben kingsley's performance was still a  highlight of iron man 3. kingsley's  acting career includes four academy  award nominations and he took home the  1983 best actor award for playing the  indian icon gandhi in the biopic of the  same name  a mid-credits scene in 2013's thor the  dark world saw the first appearance of  tanalir tivonne who goes by the alias  the collector after this cameo the  character would play a major role in  2014's guardians of the galaxy portrayed  as a man obsessed with collecting some  of the rarest artifacts in the galaxy  benicio del toro who played the  collector in all of his appearances has  been nominated for an academy award  twice both for best actor in a  supporting role in 2001 he won his first  time out for his performance as javier  rodriguez in the stephen soderbergh  crime film traffic he would get  nominated again in 2004 for his role as  ex-convict jack jordan in alejandro  gonzalez and yurito's 21 grams  2014's captain am