val and affection  there we go  marvel movies don't get more epic than  oscar winner chloe zhao's 2021 superhero  film eternals the film follows a group  of extraterrestrials across thousands of  years as they work to defend earth from  other alien invaders one of the core  members of the group is thina a warrior  eternal who can create weapons out of  cosmic energy dina is played by angelina  jolie who has been nominated for the  academy award twice and was even honored  with the gene herschel humanitarian  award for her work outside of film jolie  earned her academy award for her work as  psychiatric patient lisa rowe in the  drama girl interrupted winning for best  supporting actress the second time jolie  was nominated was for best actress in  changelit in this drama by clint  eastwood she plays a mother whose son  gets kidnapped only to have a different  child return to her  there are two post-credit scenes in  eternals that introduce several new  characters the first is the introduction  of harry styles arrows known as star fox  in the comics the second gives us a hint  of kit harington's black knight but  before fans are able to see more of the  character a voice from off-screen  interrupts him before the screen cuts to  black  sure you're ready for that mr whitman  that voice is our first tease of  mahershala ali's portrayal of blade a  vampire hunter previously portrayed by  western snipes in the original blade  trilogy ali has already been in the mcu  before playing the villain cottonmouth  in the luke cage series outside of his  marvel projects ali has been nominated  for and won best supporting actor twice  the first was for playing drug dealer  wan in moonlight and the second was for  playing don shirley in green book his  first win made ali the first muslim to  ever win an acting oscar  the mcu has expanded across all of time  and space so it seems only natural that  the franchise would start crossing into  different universes as well we got  glimpses 