 screenplay this  would mark the second win for co-writer  and director alexander payne and the  first win for the other two co-writers  matt faxon and jim rash rash has  co-written and co-directed two other  films after the descendants alongside  faxen and also received praise for his  role as dean craig pelton in nbc's  community rash also made a brief  appearance in captain america civil war  as a staff member of mit it makes sense  considering that directors joe and  anthony russo directed several episodes  of community before jumping into the mcu  the mcu television shows on disney plus  have taken fans to many different places  one division turned the marvel universe  into a classic sitcom while loki  introduced several different versions of  the fan favorite character moon knight  offers an even wilder tale following the  multiple personalities of the titular  hero whether it's the mercenary mark  spector or museum employee steven grant  both are heavily influenced by the  egyptian god khanshu kareem al-hakim  provided the onset performance for  khanshu while f murray abraham voiced  the character you might know abraham  from homeland or the grand budapest  hotel but his most revered work happened  several years prior the 1984 film  amadeus told the story of wolf gang  amadeus mozart and his rivalry with  composer antonio salieri the latter  character was played by abraham who won  the academy award for best actor for his  performance the film would eventually go  on to win an additional seven academy  awards including best picture  doctor strange in the multiverse of  madness is filled with cameos and  special appearances alternate versions  of past superheroes and the mcu debut of  patrick stewart's professor charles  xavier from the x-men series one of the  film's post-credit scenes had one more  surprise up its sleeve though when all  was said and done doctor strange was  approached by the sorceress clia for a  special mission involving an incursion  that must be stopped clear was played by  charlize theron who has been nominated  for the academy award for best actress  three times she won her first nomination  for playing serial killer eileen warnos  in 2003's monster her next two  nominations came from her roles in north  country and bombshell both films telling  stories of women fighting against sexual  harassment in the workplace you've  called women you don't like  fat pigs  dogs  slobs and disgusting animals  between her work as cipher in the fast  and furious series and her potentially  big role as clia theron will definitely  be busy for a while  you can always count on english actor  christian bale to turn in a stellar  acting performance especially  considering the controversial physical  transformations he goes through for some  of these roles from the weight he gained  for his role as irving rosenfeld in  american hustle and dick cheney in vice  to the weight he lost for the machinist  in rescue don he's never been afraid to  embrace a full-body makeover the  transformations worked as he was  nominated for the academy award for best  actor for the first two bale was also  nominated for best supporting actor for  playing michael bury in the big short  and dickie eklund in the fighter winning  for the latter bale is one of the many  actors to portray batman doing so in  christopher nolan's dark knight trilogy  a decade after the final film in the  trilogy was released bale has returned  to the world of superheroes as gore the  god butcher in taiko ytt's thor love and  thunder  bale and portman aren't the only big  names joining the mcu with thor love and  thunder perhaps the biggest new face is  russell crowe who will be playing the  olympian king zeus like bale crowe had  experience in dc films before making the  jump to the mcu playing superman's  father jorel and man of steel from 2000  to 2002 crow was nominated for best  actor three times he earned praise for  his roles in the insider and a beautiful  mind and he won for his role as maximus  decimus meridius in riley scott's  gladiator  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  your favorite stars are coming soon  subscribe to our youtube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss a single one  [Music]

